{"seq":1,"slug":"haccp-system","title":"研究生 食品安全科学 — HACCP体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/agriculture/food-safety-science/control-systems/haccp-system","wordCount":2075,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-食品安全科学-haccp体系\">研究生 食品安全科学 — HACCP体系</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>HACCP（Hazard Analysis and Critical Control Points，危害分析与关键控制点）是一套系统化、预防性的食品安全管理方法，通过识别食品生产过程中的显著危害并在关键控制点实施有效控制措施，确保食品安全。HACCP起源于1960年代NASA和Pillsbury公司为宇航员食品安全开发的质量保证方法，经过数十年的发展和完善，已成为全球食品安全管理的基石性制度。Codex Alimentarius Commission发布的HACCP指南是国际公认的标准框架。</p>\n<p>七大原则体系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原则1：危害分析（Hazard Analysis）</strong>：识别和评估食品链各环节的生物性、化学性和物理性危害</li>\n<li><strong>原则2：确定关键控制点（CCP Determination）</strong>：确定能够控制已识别显著危害的关键工序步骤</li>\n<li><strong>原则3：建立关键限值（Critical Limits）</strong>：为每个CCP设定可测量的安全控制参数</li>\n<li><strong>原则4：建立监控程序（Monitoring）</strong>：设计对CCP控制状态的系统性观察或测量方案</li>\n<li><strong>原则5：建立纠偏措施（Corrective Actions）</strong>：当监控显示CCP偏离关键限值时的处置程序</li>\n<li><strong>原则6：建立验证程序（Verification）</strong>：确认HACCP计划有效实施的活动</li>\n<li><strong>原则7：建立记录和文件体系（Documentation）</strong>：完整的HACCP实施和监控记录</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"haccp的前提方案\">HACCP的前提方案</h3><p>HACCP不是孤立运行的管理工具，它建立在一系列前提方案（Prerequisite Programs, PRPs）之上。PRPs提供基本的卫生和操作条件，使HACCP计划能够聚焦于过程特异性的关键危害：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>前提方案类型</th>\n<th>主要内容</th>\n<th>相关标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>良好操作规范（GMP）</td>\n<td>人员卫生、设施设计、设备维护</td>\n<td>21 CFR 110 / GB 14881</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卫生标准操作规程（SSOP）</td>\n<td>清洁消毒、交叉污染防控、水质管理</td>\n<td>SSOP 8项关键要素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商管理</td>\n<td>原料验收标准、供应商审核</td>\n<td>GFSI基准要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虫害控制</td>\n<td>防鼠防虫措施、监控频率</td>\n<td>专业PCO服务标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过敏原管理</td>\n<td>交叉接触风险控制、标识管理</td>\n<td>Codex过敏原管理指南</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>培训</td>\n<td>食品安全意识、岗位操作培训</td>\n<td>年度培训计划</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ISO 22000:2018将PRPs（前提方案）、OPRPs（操作性前提方案）和CCP三者纳入统一的食品安全管理体系框架。OPRPs控制那些风险级别介于PRPs和CCP之间的危害——不需要设定关键限值，但需要行动准则（action criteria）和纠正行动。</p>\n<h3 id=\"危害分析方法论\">危害分析方法论</h3><p>危害分析是HACCP计划的核心起点，分为两个阶段：</p>\n<p><strong>阶段一——危害识别</strong>：系统列出食品链每个步骤中可能出现的所有生物性、化学性和物理性危害。需要参考的信息来源包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产品配方和加工工艺流程图</li>\n<li>历史召回和投诉数据</li>\n<li>科学文献和流行病学数据</li>\n<li>法规要求和行业标准</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>阶段二——危害评估</strong>：对每个已识别危害的显著性进行评估。显著危害（Significant Hazard）是指&quot;合理可能发生&quot;且&quot;一旦发生会导致不可接受的健康后果&quot;的危害。评估工具通常使用风险矩阵：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>风险等级</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>严重性</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>可能性</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">风险等级 = 严重性(S) \\times 可能性(L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">风险等级</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">严重性</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可能性</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>可能性低(1)</th>\n<th>可能性中(2)</th>\n<th>可能性高(3)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>严重性高(3)</strong></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>严重性中(2)</strong></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>严重性低(1)</strong></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>风险等级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 的危害通常被判定为显著危害，需要在CCP或OPRP层面进行控制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ccp确定-判断树方法\">CCP确定——判断树方法</h3><p>Codex判断树（Decision Tree）是确定CCP的标准化工具，包含四个顺序问题：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q1{Q1: 本步骤是否有控制措施?} --&gt;|是| Q2{Q2: 本步骤是否专门设计用于&lt;br&gt;消除或降低危害至可接受水平?}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|否| Q1a{需要在本步骤控制吗?}&#10;    Q1a --&gt;|是| Q1b[修改步骤/产品/过程]&#10;    Q1a --&gt;|否| Q1c[非CCP]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|是| CCP[此步骤为CCP]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3{Q3: 污染是否可能超过&lt;br&gt;可接受水平或增加至不可接受水平?}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|否| Q3a[非CCP]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|是| Q4{Q4: 后续步骤能否消除&lt;br&gt;或降低危害至可接受水平?}&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|是| Q4a[非CCP]&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|否| CCP2[此步骤为CCP]\">graph TD\n    Q1{Q1: 本步骤是否有控制措施?} --&gt;|是| Q2{Q2: 本步骤是否专门设计用于&lt;br&gt;消除或降低危害至可接受水平?}\n    Q1 --&gt;|否| Q1a{需要在本步骤控制吗?}\n    Q1a --&gt;|是| Q1b[修改步骤/产品/过程]\n    Q1a --&gt;|否| Q1c[非CCP]\n    Q2 --&gt;|是| CCP[此步骤为CCP]\n    Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3{Q3: 污染是否可能超过&lt;br&gt;可接受水平或增加至不可接受水平?}\n    Q3 --&gt;|否| Q3a[非CCP]\n    Q3 --&gt;|是| Q4{Q4: 后续步骤能否消除&lt;br&gt;或降低危害至可接受水平?}\n    Q4 --&gt;|是| Q4a[非CCP]\n    Q4 --&gt;|否| CCP2[此步骤为CCP]</pre><p>重要提示：判断树是辅助工具而非决定性工具。最终CCP的确定需要结合HACCP小组的专业判断和实际工艺条件。常见的CCP包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>烹饪/杀菌步骤（控制生物性危害的中心温度和保持时间）</li>\n<li>冷却步骤（控制微生物再增殖）</li>\n<li>金属探测/X射线步骤（控制物理性危害）</li>\n<li>配料称量步骤（控制过敏原或食品添加剂用量）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"关键限值与监控\">关键限值与监控</h3><p>关键限值（Critical Limit, CL）必须是可测量和可观察的参数。常见CL类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CCP类型</th>\n<th>关键限值参数</th>\n<th>典型设定值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>巴氏杀菌</td>\n<td>温度×时间</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>72</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">72°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">72°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span>秒（或<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>63</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">63°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">63°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span>分钟）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UHT灭菌</td>\n<td>温度×时间</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>135</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">135°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">135°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>烹饪</td>\n<td>中心温度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>74</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 74°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">74°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>（家禽）/ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 70°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>（碎肉）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷却</td>\n<td>温度×时间</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>→<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>21</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>h; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>21</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>→<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金属探测</td>\n<td>灵敏度</td>\n<td>Fe <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span>mm, SUS <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>2.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 2.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span>mm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热灌装</td>\n<td>灌装温度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>85</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 85°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">85°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>巴氏杀菌的微生物灭活效果以D值和z值定量描述：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>D值</strong>：在特定温度下将目标微生物数量减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span>（1个对数级）所需的时间</li>\n<li><strong>z值</strong>：使D值变化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span>（1个对数级）所需的温度变化</li>\n</ul>\n<p>杀菌效果（F值）计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><msup><mn>10</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mi>z</mi></mfrac></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{ref} = D_{ref} \\cdot (log N_0 - log N_t) = \\int_0^t 10^{\\frac{T(t) - T_{ref}}{z}} dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\